, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T08:27:31-07:00","id":1121320,"title":"","content":"I love this micro template it's my 1st Choice now because it's best immortality opinion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T03:41:05-07:00","id":1123387,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1170_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1170\" data-vbnamecard=\"1170\">amechra</a> - If you would normally die while the Special effect of Store the Soul is in play, do you &quot;detach&quot; any other soul you might possess at the time? It doesn't <i>say</i> anything, but you <i>have</i> been essentially dismembered or splattered into paste. I would think it would make it hard to keep a hold of a soul in those cases, even if you will eventually heal (because you aren't fully dead).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{